      after: Q("amd3", 2, "Notwithstanding the above, during the Term of the CfDA, if deemed necessary, SECI shall have the right to designate the Peak Hours (including specific Time-Blocks) during which the RPD shall supply power from the Project through the Power Exchanges. The RPD shall accordingly ensure availability of such power for scheduling and sale through the Power Exchanges during the Peak Hours/Time-Blocks so designated by SECI. SECI may, as deemed necessary, undertake or facilitate the scheduling and/or bidding of such power on behalf of the RPD in the Power Exchanges, and the RPD shall provide all necessary cooperation and information in this regard. Further, during the period in which the MCPs in the above markets are expected to remain lower than the Strike Price for a sustained period, RPD may be allowed to sell the electricity in suitable markets based on the approval of SECI/MNRE."),
